List recorded sessions, newest first

Usage: hh list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>  Maximum number of sessions to print (default 20) [default: 20]
      --json           Emit JSON instead of a table
  -h, --help           Print help

Examples:
  hh list             the 20 most recent sessions
  hh list --limit 50  the 50 most recent sessions
  hh list --json      machine-readable output
